# Harness SDD — Project Instructions for Gemini CLI

This file is auto-generated from `.agents/agentic.json` and tells the Gemini CLI
how to operate on this project under the **Harness SDD** framework.

## 1. Mandatory Pre-Task Checklist

1. Run `./check.sh --quiet`. If it fails, stop and fix the environment.
2. Run `./.agents/bootstrap.sh brief` for the active feature, its next task,
   and the session state. Do not read `feature_list.json` or progress logs in full.
3. Load anything else only when the task needs it; `AGENTS.md §2` says when.

